# Backend

- NestJS + TypeScript; dependency injection everywhere
- Thin controllers; business logic in services / domain packages
- Validate every request (DTOs / schema validation)
- Wire Stripe, WHM, registrars, email, storage only through provider interfaces in packages
- REST under `/api/v1` with public / auth / portal / admin / webhooks audiences (`docs/API.md`)
- WebSockets for notifications, ticket/project activity, AI streaming
- Slow/retiable work → BullMQ (Redis); job payloads carry IDs, workers load MariaDB state
- Webhooks: verify signatures, persist idempotently, enqueue processing
- Idempotency keys on payments, domain register, hosting create
- Cursor pagination; stable problem-details errors
- No ad-hoc DB clients — use `@agency/database` only
